{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方两行大号白色文字，字号最大、亮度最高、位置靠上；随后容易被下方另一句同样醒目的白色大字吸引。右上角目录和紫色文字属于次级入口，下半部分金色音符动画也有一定视觉吸引力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"隐约抓到他正在纠结是否回到以前的生活，但具体纠结的动机不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心慌、犹豫、不安。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他究竟是舍不得以前的生活，还是只想在难受时有人陪伴；紫色文字补充的旧念头反复出现、刚稳定又散开的过程，以及再次遇见无措的自己。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样醒目的白色大字争夺主视线。\",\n    \"单块太长，第一块包含两种不同的心理动机，需要读完整句才能分辨。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块里：第一块交代纠结的内容，第二块才交代这种念头带来的心慌，需要拼接才能理解处境与感受的关系。\",\n    \"紫色补充文字连续排列多个短语，需要在多条信息中挑选重点。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5a123176-d6ab-49a3-ac25-24649e8bf9dc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T032233208054Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:22:57.696048+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9762d8ba28d2808d5ce514712743a4b16f79bb5e8e17f153c3f534da7d368d06", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": 